I checked out the buggy wanderer screens (13,16,17,20), and the fixes that
Randy Davis posted (rjd@occrsh.ATT.COM). I also worked on 18, but haven't been
able to figure it out yet. Will the poster who said it was solvable please
certify that it is consistently solvable.

Randy's suggested changes to 20 and 16 are small and don't seem to change the
character of the screens much, so I went ahead and installed them (thanks 
Randy). The changes to 13 and 17 seemed to me to be bigger though, with the
only tough puzzle in 13 made relatively easy, and the corner puzzle in 17
pretty much removed. I think there's still a bug in Randy's 17 too.

After lots of playing around I found that changing only one character makes 13
possible, though REALLY hard. The only change is the deletion of one '='
character. I've solved my changed screen 13 four times in a row, but the
solution is tricky to the point were you might not want to use my change.

