Screen 17 seemes to have three fatal flaws. There are the land mines and the
rock dropped by the baby monster in the lower right hand corner, and the gold
to the right of the teleporter (just how were you going to get that one
Randy?). If anybody can find a way around any of these flaws without changing
the screen, please post it. My solution was to move the teleport destination
to one of the land mines (it's not really needed in its old location), and to
move a rock and its dirt up one. This clobbers an '=' and changes the nature
of some of the traps, but at least all of the traps are still there. I've
solved my changed screen 17 twice.

